{"id":"eigentu_mer","lemma":"Eigentümer","pos":"noun","rank":4826,"glosses":["the one who in general has the right to do as he will with a corporeal object and exclude others from it"],"ipa":"/ˈaɪ̯ɡəntyːmɐ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/27/De-Eigent%C3%BCmer.ogg/De-Eigent%C3%BCmer.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Eigentümers","plural":"Eigentümer","feminine":"Eigentümerin"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich bin nicht die Eigentümerin.","en":"I'm not the owner.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/798115","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Wir sind die neuen Eigentümer.","en":"We're the new owners.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"new","l":"neu"},null]},{"text":"Ihr seid die Eigentümer.","en":"You're the owners.","words":[{"g":"you (pl.) / her"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Sind Sie der Eigentümer dieses Hauses?","en":"Are you the owner of this house?","words":[{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},{"g":"house, building","l":"Haus"}]},{"text":"Ich bin nicht der Eigentümer.","en":"I'm not the owner.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"the"},null]}]}